# =============================================================================
# PQC-ONLY SSH honeypot -- sshd configuration  (requires OQS-OpenSSH)
# =============================================================================
# Offers ONLY pure post-quantum key exchange -- NO classical hybrid, NO
# classical fallback. Mainline OpenSSH deliberately does not ship pure-PQC kex
# (it always combines ML-KEM with a classical curve), so this variant MUST run
# on an OQS-OpenSSH build. See Dockerfile.pqc-only.
#
# RESEARCH PURPOSE: measure "hard" post-quantum failures -- clients with no PQC
# support cannot complete key exchange at all, which is the signal we want.
#
# KEX NAMES (verified against the open-quantum-safe/openssh repo, fork of
# OpenSSH 10.2). The PURE (non-hybrid) methods are:
#     mlkem768-sha256      ML-KEM-768 (FIPS 203)         -- current name
#     kyber-768-sha384     CRYSTALS-Kyber-768            -- legacy name
# NOTE: pure methods have NO "@openquantumsafe.org" suffix -- that suffix is
# used only by the HYBRID methods (e.g. x25519-ml-kem-512-sha256@openquantumsafe.org).
#
# !!! sshd REFUSES TO START if a KexAlgorithms entry is unknown to the build.
#     The Docker image (openquantumsafe/openssh:latest) is ~12 months old and
#     may predate the kyber->mlkem rename, so it may support only ONE of the two
#     names below. Run `ssh -Q kex` INSIDE the image and keep only what it lists.
# =============================================================================

Port 2224
AddressFamily inet
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

# Pure PQC key exchange only -- NO classical algorithms. Keep only image-supported names.
KexAlgorithms mlkem768-sha256,kyber-768-sha384

HostKey /etc/ssh/keys/ssh_host_ed25519_key
HostKeyAlgorithms ssh-ed25519
Ciphers chacha20-poly1305@openssh.com,aes256-gcm@openssh.com
MACs    hmac-sha2-512-etm@openssh.com,hmac-sha2-256-etm@openssh.com

PermitRootLogin            no
PasswordAuthentication     yes
PermitEmptyPasswords       no
PubkeyAuthentication       no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
MaxAuthTries               3
MaxSessions                2
LoginGraceTime             20
AllowTcpForwarding         no
AllowAgentForwarding       no
X11Forwarding              no
PermitTunnel               no
PermitTTY                  no
PermitUserRC               no
Subsystem sftp             /bin/false

LogLevel       DEBUG1
SyslogFacility AUTH
StrictModes    yes
